message:
Empty coupon code (`""`) caused `apply_coupon` to raise an unguarded `KeyError` from the COUPONS dict, crashing `cart.total()` and locking out the user's session. Added an explicit guard that raises `ValueError("Invalid coupon code")` for blank or unknown codes — callers receive a clean, catchable error instead of a crash. Full suite green (34 passed).

@m13-s1-ops-maint

